This directory and everything under it is MIT, while the rest of Hashira is
AGPL-3.0-or-later. That is deliberate: the editor core is the part worth lifting into
somebody else's project, and a copyleft licence on it would make that a legal
conversation instead of a copy and paste. See LICENSING.md at the root for what the
boundary is and what it does not cover.

